        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Vision of the Future, Thrawn trilogy, Survivor's Quest\n- People: Timothy Zahn\n- Concepts: Hand of Thrawn novels, Heir to the Empire trilogy\n\nFacts:\n- Timothy Zahn wrote the best-selling science fiction Thrawn trilogy, which is also known as the Heir to the Empire trilogy.\n- Vision of the Future is the second of the two Hand of Thrawn novels by Timothy Zahn, and those novels follow the Thrawn trilogy.\n- In 1998, Timothy Zahn published the Star Wars novel Vision of the Future.\n- Survivor's Quest was written by Timothy Zahn as a sequel to his 1998 Star Wars novel Vision of the Future.",
